# Local Workflow Rules

Normal flow: director -> gameplay -> presentation -> qa -> director.

- Handoffs point to committed states and describe only the observable slice to review.
- Gameplay does not change visual direction unless the accepted rules require it.
- Presentation does not silently change scoring, board rules, progression, or RNG behavior.
- QA verifies through the public browser surface and records screenshots for visual claims.
- The director alone merges verified work and decides release readiness.
